he workspace. Is there any additional setting required to ensure that the data are stored correctly? Thank you <\/p>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta answer-tag-list tags_ans_lp\"><strong>Tags<\/strong>:<a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'data workspace saving from simulink scope'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">data workspace saving from simulink scope<\/a><\/div>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>1<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>19<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>2<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">1<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answer<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/100496-why-do-i-receive-mathworks-licensing-error-8?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">Why do I receive MathWorks Licensing Error 8?<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div clas