y-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">1<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answer<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/101155-how-do-i-obtain-the-prerelease-for-a-new-matlab-version?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">How do I obtain the Prerelease for a new MATLAB version?<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/4622813\">\n                                    <img alt=\"MathWorks Support Team\" class=\"rounded-circle community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/4622813?s_tid=ans_recom_user\" width=\"24\" onerror=\"img_not_found(this, '\/responsive_image\/100\/0\/0\/0\/0\/cache\/matlabcentral\/profiles\/profilepic_default.gif');\">\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow-1 ms-2\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/4622813\">MathWorks Support Team<\/a> on 14 June 2012\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <p class=\"post_body text-wrap d-none d-md-block search_result_desc\"> I have received a notification that a new MATLAB Prerelease is available, and I would like to install the Prerelease. How do I do so? kA0i00000007kxxCAA 000004283<\/p>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta answer-tag-list tags_ans_lp\"><strong>Tags<\/strong>:<a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'prerelease'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">prerelease<\/a><\/div>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>3<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>45<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>0<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">1<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answer<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/2176614-why-is-the-matlab-r2024b-and-r2025a-prerelease-crashing-with-libmwagentspflegacyservicepublisher-dl?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">Why is the MATLAB R2024b and R2025a Prerelease crashing with &quot;libmwagentspflegacyservicepublisher.dll&quot; in the stack trace?<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/4622813\">\n                                    <img alt=\"MathWorks Support Team\" class=\"rounded-circle community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/4622813?s_tid=ans_recom_user\" width=\"24\" onerror=\"img_not_found(this, '\/responsive_image\/100\/0\/0\/0\/0\/cache\/matlabcentral\/profiles\/profilepic_default.gif');\">\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow-1 ms-2\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/4622813\">MathWorks Support Team<\/a> on 24 April 2025\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <p class=\"post_body text-wrap d-none d-md-block search_result_desc\"> I am experiencing a sporadic crash in MATLAB. MATLAB crashes shortly after opening while idle, or when attempting to open Simulink, or attaching the Visual Studio Debugger. Below is the crash log that I receive: Crash Log: ----------------------------------------------------------------------------...<\/p>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta answer-tag-list tags_ans_lp\"><strong>Tags<\/strong>:<a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'matlabidle'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">matlabidle<\/a><span class=\"separator\"><\/span><a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'sporadiccrash'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">sporadiccrash<\/a><span class=\"separator\"><\/span><a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'opensimulink'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">opensimulink<\/a><\/div>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>0<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>35<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>0<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">1<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answer<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/255531-plot-a-matrix?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">&quot;Plot&quot; a matrix<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/6710402\">\n                                    <img alt=\"Luciano Magrini\" class=\"rounded-circle community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/6710402?s_tid=ans_recom_user\" width=\"24\" onerror=\"img_not_found(this, '\/responsive_image\/100\/0\/0\/0\/0\/cache\/matlabcentral\/profiles\/profilepic_default.gif');\">\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow-1 ms-2\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/6710402\">Luciano Magrini<\/a> on 17 November 2015\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <p class=\"post_body text-wrap d-none d-md-block search_result_desc\"> Hello, dear members of this community! Can someone help me? I have an array whose entries represent energy. Would I like to &quot;plot&quot; this array using a color palette, so you can quickly see the regions of high concentration of energy and also the low concentration of energy. How can I do th...<\/p>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta answer-tag-list tags_ans_lp\"><strong>Tags<\/strong>:<a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'matriz'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">matriz<\/a><span class=\"separator\"><\/span><a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'plotting'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">plotting<\/a><\/div>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>0<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>31<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>0<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer, 2 Answers\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">3<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answers<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/411541-how-to-convert-m-file-to-txt-file-in-matlab?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">how to convert .m file to .txt file in matlab<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/13185775\">\n                                    <img alt=\"farha nazneen\" class=\"rounded-circle community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/13185775?s_tid=ans_recom_user\" width=\"24\" onerror=\"img_not_found(this, '\/responsive_image\/100\/0\/0\/0\/0\/cache\/matlabcentral\/profiles\/profilepic_default.gif');\">\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow-1 ms-2\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/13185775\">farha nazneen<\/a> on 22 July 2018\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <p class=\"post_body text-wrap d-none d-md-block search_result_desc\"> Hello i generated a sine wave signal in matlab i got some values in workspace,i wanted to convert .m file to a .text file please do let me know how to proceed.The below is the attachment of my file. <\/p>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>0<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>32<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>0<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">1<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answer<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/2174298-symbolic-math-toolbox-installation?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">Symbolic math toolbox installation.<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/35664244\">\n                                    <img alt=\"Manolis\" class=\"rounded-circle community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/35664244?s_tid=ans_recom_user\" width=\"24\" onerror=\"img_not_found(this, '\/responsive_image\/100\/0\/0\/0\/0\/cache\/matlabcentral\/profiles\/profilepic_default.gif');\">\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow-1 ms-2\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/35664244\">Manolis<\/a> on 20 February 2025\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <p class=\"post_body text-wrap d-none d-md-block search_result_desc\">Good morning. Since yesterday I am trying to get and use Symbolic... I have paid already at the bank. The internet connection at home is perfect. So what&#39;s next ?<\/p>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta answer-tag-list tags_ans_lp\"><strong>Tags<\/strong>:<a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'app installation'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">app installation<\/a><\/div>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>0<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>32<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>3<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">1<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answer<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/507962-why-do-i-get-the-error-unrecognized-function-or-variable-ctfroot-when-running-matlabwebappserv?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">Why do I get the error &quot;Unrecognized function or variable &#39;ctfroot&#39;&quot; when running &quot;MATLABWebAppServer.exe&quot;?<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/4622813\">\n                                    <img alt=\"MathWorks Support Team\" class=\"rounded-circle community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/4622813?s_tid=ans_recom_user\" width=\"24\" onerror=\"img_not_found(this, '\/responsive_image\/100\/0\/0\/0\/0\/cache\/matlabcentral\/profiles\/profilepic_default.gif');\">\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow-1 ms-2\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/4622813\">MathWorks Support Team<\/a> on 27 February 2020\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <p class=\"post_body text-wrap d-none d-md-block search_result_desc\">Why do I get the error &quot;Unrecognized function or variable &#39;ctfroot&#39;&quot; when running the Development version of MATLAB Web App Server - &quot;MATLABWebAppServer.exe&quot;? Here is a screenshot of the exact error: kA00Z000000skZzSAI 000123446<\/p>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta answer-tag-list tags_ans_lp\"><strong>Tags<\/strong>:<a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'matlabwebappserver'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">matlabwebappserver<\/a><span class=\"separator\"><\/span><a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'ctfroot'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">ctfroot<\/a><span class=\"separator\"><\/span><a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'unrecognized'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">unrecognized<\/a><\/div>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>0<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>34<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>0<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">1<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answer<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/2184689-r2026a-home-insert-row-into-table-using-the-workspace-editor-arbitrary-position?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">R2026a Home: Insert row into table using the Workspace Editor (arbitrary position)<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/23654092\">\n                                    <img alt=\"Ravi Narasimhan\" class=\"rounded-circle community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/23654092?s_tid=ans_recom_user\" width=\"24\" onerror=\"img_not_found(this, '\/responsive_image\/100\/0\/0\/0\/0\/cache\/matlabcentral\/profiles\/profilepic_default.gif');\">\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow-1 ms-2\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/23654092\">Ravi Narasimhan<\/a> on 19 August 2026\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <p class=\"post_body text-wrap d-none d-md-block search_result_desc\"> Using the workspace editor, I can insert a row at an arbitrary position in an array by clicking the row header and selecting Insert Row Above or Below from the context menu or the ribbon. Is there any way to do this for a table? The context menu doesn&#39;t appear and I can only delete rows via the...<\/p>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta answer-tag-list tags_ans_lp\"><strong>Tags<\/strong>:<a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'workspace editor'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">workspace editor<\/a><span class=\"separator\"><\/span><a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'insert rows'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">insert rows<\/a><\/div>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>0<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>134<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>0<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">1<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answer<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/456742-reading-a-csv-file?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">Reading a csv file<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/15201742\">\n                                    <img alt=\"Cordelia David\" class=\"rounded-circle community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/15201742?s_tid=ans_recom_user\" width=\"24\" onerror=\"img_not_found(this, '\/responsive_image\/100\/0\/0\/0\/0\/cache\/matlabcentral\/profiles\/profilepic_default.gif');\">\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow-1 ms-2\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/15201742\">Cordelia David<\/a> on 16 April 2019\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <p class=\"post_body text-wrap d-none d-md-block search_result_desc\"> Hello Matlab community! I&#39;m a begginer at Matlab, and I was given a project to complete. There&#39;s a few more steps to it, but right now I&#39;m a little stuck on one particular part. I&#39;m trying to read variables and their values from an easily readable csv file. It needs to be easy to re...<\/p>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta answer-tag-list tags_ans_lp\"><strong>Tags<\/strong>:<a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'readtable'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">readtable<\/a><\/div>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>0<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>597<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>0<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer, 2 Answers\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">3<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answers<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/173629-how-to-change-figure-size?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">How to change figure size?<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/6006295\">\n                                    <img alt=\"John\" class=\"rounded-circle community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/6006295?s_tid=ans_recom_user\" width=\"24\" onerror=\"img_not_found(this, '\/responsive_image\/100\/0\/0\/0\/0\/cache\/matlabcentral\/profiles\/profilepic_default.gif');\">\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow-1 ms-2\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/6006295\">John<\/a> on 30 January 2015\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <p class=\"post_body text-wrap d-none d-md-block search_result_desc\"> I&#39;m trying to change the figure size. In the example below, I expected figure(2) to have a different size. In order to achieve this, I added: set(gcf, &#39;PaperUnits&#39;, &#39;inches&#39;); set(gcf, &#39;PaperSize&#39;, [4 2]); set(gcf, &#39;PaperPositionMode&#39;, &#39;manual&#39;); set(gcf,...<\/p>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>6<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>552<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>0<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer, 4 Answers\"><span class=\"answers_meta_count\">5<\/span><span class=\"answers_meta_label\">answers<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-default lp-answers-card search_result add_padding_0\">\n        <div class=\"panel-body w-100\">\n            <p class=\"h3 question_title add_margin_12\"><a class=\"card-title\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/480973-put-label-in-colorbar?s_tid=ans_recom_leaf\">Put label in colorbar<\/a><\/p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n                <div class=\"search_result_content\">\n                    <div class=\"post_meta search_result_meta\">\n                        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/14644923\">\n                                    <img alt=\"Ting-Yu Chueh\" class=\"rounded-circle community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/14644923?s_tid=ans_recom_user\" width=\"24\" onerror=\"img_not_found(this, '\/responsive_image\/100\/0\/0\/0\/0\/cache\/matlabcentral\/profiles\/profilepic_default.gif');\">\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow-1 ms-2\">\n                                <a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/14644923\">Ting-Yu Chueh<\/a> on 18 September 2019\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <p class=\"post_body text-wrap d-none d-md-block search_result_desc\"> I put the label (&#39;Power (dB&#39;) in my color bar, and the code is below: a=colorbar; ylabel(a,&#39;Power (db)&#39;,&#39;FontSize&#39;,16,&#39;Rotation&#39;,270); However, the label is too close the colorbar (see the figure). Can anyone help me? Thanks! Also, how can I to put the different titl...<\/p>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta answer-tag-list tags_ans_lp\"><strong>Tags<\/strong>:<a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/?term=tag:'colorbar unit'&s_tid=ans_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">colorbar unit<\/a><\/div>\n                    <div class=\"search_result_meta feed_stats\"><ul class=\"list-inline -has_list_separators\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like feed_votes\" aria-label=\"votes\"><\/span>4<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-watch feed_views\" aria-label=\"views\"><\/span>481<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-feedback feed_comments\" aria-label=\"comments\"><\/span>1<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"lp-answers-card_sidebar\"><div class=\"search_result_supplemental_content justify-content-center align-items-center d-flex flex-column\"><div class=\"answers_meta -is_accepted\" data-accepted-label=\"Accepted Answer\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"1 Accepted Answer, 1 Answer\"><span class=